<view class="hub"><view class="english-heading"><view class="eyebrow"><lookup-text text="REST. MEET. KEEP GOING." source="页面寄语"/></view><speech-button text="REST. MEET. KEEP GOING." compact="{{true}}" label="听读"/></view><view class="title">{{mountain.name}} · 营地 {{campNumber}}</view><view class="subtitle">同一盏灯下，遇见也曾走到这里的旅人。</view><view class="camp-art">△<text>在这里歇一歇</text></view>
<view wx:if="{{locked}}" class="notice">营地尚未抵达。完成这段学习后再来看看吧。</view>
<view wx:elif="{{!configured}}" class="card empty">你已经抵达了这座营地。<view class="spaced">营地社交尚未开放。云端连接完成后，这里会显示真实到访的玩家。</view><view class="muted spaced">先休息一会，继续收集下一段山路的单词。</view></view>
<block wx:else><view wx:if="{{!joined}}" class="card"><view class="name">留下你的到访足迹</view><view class="muted spaced">加入后，同营地玩家可以看到你的公开头像、昵称和简介，并可关注你、给你发送私信。你可以随时屏蔽不想联系的人。</view><button class="primary full spaced" disabled="{{loading}}" loading="{{loading}}" bindtap="join">加入营地，看看同行的人</button></view>
<block wx:else><view class="row section"><text class="section-title">到过这座营地的旅人</text><button class="small-btn" bindtap="loadMembers" disabled="{{loading}}">刷新</button></view><view class="muted">这里记录到访，不代表玩家当前在线。</view>
<view class="card spaced" wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="uid"><view class="row"><view class="avatar">{{item.avatar}}</view><view class="grow"><view class="name">{{item.nickname}}</view><speech-button text="{{item.nickname}}" label="听英文" compact="{{true}}"/><view class="muted"><lookup-text text="{{item.bio||'把一步一步，走成自己的故事。'}}" source="营地玩家简介"/></view><speech-button text="{{item.bio}}" label="听英文" compact="{{true}}"/></view><text class="link" data-uid="{{item.uid}}" bindtap="more">···</text></view><view class="muted spaced">{{item.joinedLabel}} 到访</view><view class="row spaced"><button class="secondary grow" data-uid="{{item.uid}}" bindtap="follow" disabled="{{!!busy}}">{{item.following?'已关注 · 取消':'＋ 关注'}}</button><button class="primary grow" data-uid="{{item.uid}}" bindtap="chat" disabled="{{!!busy}}">私信</button></view></view>
<view wx:if="{{!members.length && !loading && !cursor}}" class="empty">暂时还没有其他可见的旅人。<view>你的到访已记录，下次再来看看。</view></view><button wx:if="{{cursor}}" class="secondary full spaced" data-more="true" bindtap="loadMembers" disabled="{{loading}}">查看更多旅人</button></block>
<view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="muted spaced">正在连接营地…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{needsProfile}}" class="secondary full" bindtap="goProfile">去「我的」设置公开资料</button></block></view>
